<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength of Baculites compressus at 94.16 µm (Pass 2) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The same Schnakenberg Jacobian and k_c formula as Pass 1, now integrated at half the previous timestep fraction. Dispersion r = 0.99994. The flank image remains a seeded Fourier packet rather than the time-integrated 2D field, which is why this is not higher." ;
